// Syncthing reads this from the root of the `state/` folder; git carries it,
// because Syncthing does not sync it between peers.
//
// Pulumi's per-update audit trail, many times the size of the live checkpoints
// and growing with every run. Only `pulumi stack history` and manual recovery
// read it; stacks/ keeps the previous checkpoint as *.json.bak. locks/ stays
// synced so a run on one machine holds off one on another.
/.pulumi/backups
/.pulumi/history
(?d).DS_Store
